      "content": "it's just so quiet here. i walk into the kitchen and i keep expecting to hear him making tea or just... moving around. but there's nothing. it's like the house is breathing but nothing is actually alive. i don't even know why i bother waking up every morning just to face this silence. it hurts too much to even exist right now.",
